prompt_template:
Create a premium full-bleed future-sport campaign poster.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Frozen anchor object: {ANCHOR}
Motion environment: {MOTION_SCENE}
Gradient and lighting: {GRADIENT}
Exact giant display text, render verbatim as uppercase: {MAIN_TEXT}. Use one heavy geometric white sans-serif slogan only; no extra paragraphs.
Concept direction: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Build a high-end sports photograph with one sharply frozen foreground gear object, strong foreshortening and a directional corridor of optical motion trails behind it. Keep the anchor's material, edge and contact detail razor-sharp while people, surfaces and lights around it streak. Make the gradient luminous and saturated, not flat. Recompose specifically for the requested aspect ratio. Do not copy any reference-specific person, crop, logo or layout. Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}.
Generate as a 4K ultra-high-resolution raster image.
Preserve the specified reference-style texture, edge character and intentional softness at their described scale, intensity and locations. Avoid artifacts that are absent from the intended style; do not automatically denoise, sharpen, polish or distress the image.
